[h2]Build 0.9.51[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Visible steam:[/b] steam from vents, Overpressure Tank releases and bleeds, safety valves, leaks and steam bursts now hangs in the air as a white steam cloud.
[*]It spreads through open space and open doors, blows away quickly outdoors, and indoors [b]fills the room[/b] - a steam vent blowing into a closed room fogs it within a minute or two.
[*]While it hangs there, steam [b]keeps heating the room[/b] on top of the heat its source gave off, up to about 100°C. It slowly condenses, faster in a cold room.
[*]A steam burst leaves a thick cloud over its whole blast.
[*]New setting [i]Visible steam clouds[/i] to switch it off.
[/list]
